1
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:42,000
You can't keep a good cop dead.

2
00:11:12,000 --> 00:11:18,000
Dead Heat is a action, horror, science fiction film directed by Mark Goldblatt.

3
00:16:48,000 --> 00:16:54,000
Detective Roger Mortis is killed in action while investigating a string of mysterious robberies: until
he's brought back from the dead with a chemical company's secret re-animation technology.

4
00:22:24,000 --> 00:22:30,000
Now he has twelve hours to solve the case of his own
death before he dies: And stays dead.

5
00:28:00,000 --> 00:28:06,000
Det. Roger Mortis, played by Treat Williams.

6
