11
01:01:36,000 --> 01:01:42,000
Dead Heat is a 1988 American buddy cop action zombie comedy film directed by Mark Goldblatt and
starring Treat Williams, Joe Piscopo, Darren McGavin, Lindsay Frost and Vincent Price.

12
01:07:12,000 --> 01:07:18,000
The film is about an LAPD police officer who is murdered while attempting to arrest zombies who have been reanimated by the head of Dante
Laboratories in order to carry out violent armed robberies, and decides to get revenge with the help of his former partner.

13
01:12:48,000 --> 01:12:54,000
The film explores themes of police, undead, resurrection, zombie, zombification.

14
01:18:24,000 --> 01:18:30,000
The tone is lighthearted and dark and thought_provoking.
